config IWCHAOS
	tristate "iwchaos: bounded Intel Wi-Fi rate policy"
	depends on PCI && MAC80211 && CFG80211
	help
	  Enables the optional iwchaos policy bridge when the target-kernel
	  iwlmvm source is integrated by the external DKMS build. The upstream
	  iwlwifi, iwlmvm, and iwldvm modules remain the driver modules.

	  If unsure, say N.
